---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy notice" description="How Annie 3D handles your data.">
  <div class="container prose" style="padding:56px 0 96px">
    <p class="badge badge-warning">Draft for the pre-release · to be reviewed by counsel before launch</p>
    <h1 class="h2" style="margin-top:12px">Privacy notice</h1>
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Annie 3D is operated from Australia. Contact: hello@annie3d.example.</p>
    <h2>What we store</h2>
    <p>Your Google account name, email address and profile picture when you sign in; the boards, nodes, prompts and versions you create; files you upload and files we generate for you; run history and credit transactions.</p>
    <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
    <p>Account and board data in a Postgres database hosted by Neon in Sydney, Australia. Files in Cloudflare R2 object storage in the Oceania region. Pages are delivered through Cloudflare's network.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>One first-party session cookie keeps you signed in. We do not use advertising cookies.</p>
    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>Nothing is public unless you create a share link. You can revoke a link at any time.</p>
    <h2>Deleting your data</h2>
    <p>Delete boards from the canvas, or email us to delete your account and all files.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
